# Continuous native generation: the app's android/ and ios/ trees are produced by
# `expo prebuild`. Anchored to this directory: the local Expo modules under modules/
# keep their own hand-written android/ source, which must stay in git.
/android/
/ios/
# Gradle output inside the local modules (the sources beside it are tracked).
modules/*/android/build/
modules/*/android/.cxx/
*.orig.*
